# Horty AutoHammer - post-lifting beam 2.5.0 on the carriage (machine plane, mm)
# beam: title-block mass, centroid and moment of inertia from the solid model 366-2.0.0
# (cylload masstable ... post_lift_assign.csv); the post lies along the beam with its
# centre of mass at the beam centroid
title Horty post-lifting beam 2.5.0
gravity 0 -9.81
body beam
revolute O ground beam  -1069.0  99.4
actuator Sp ground -838.0 -98.6  beam -1181.0 864.4  bore=50 rod=30 min=630 max=1030 mass=8.4
mass beam_2.5.0 beam -1314.9240 1867.1464 135.0 223.1347 group=beam
mass post       beam -1314.9240 1867.1464  56.0 74.6667 group=post
